{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"あああああ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/10/12/8847087/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"童顔だからなんなんだ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"叫びたい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......\n代々木ライブの感想\nありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お知らせ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10月14日放送のドラマ\n『海の上の診療所』\n1話に玲香といくちゃんと私が\n女子大生役で出演します。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お話を聞いた時は\nびっくりしたというか、\n私でいいのかという..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、なにより嬉しくて、\nそして緊張しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ見てください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は握手会。\n1部2部3部よろしくお願いします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/10/12/8847087/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"第二弾あぶりさーもん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"からの質問回答"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スクバってどんな感じに\nデコってるのー？\n▶︎デコ...？\n紫のアメーバみたいな\nストラップひとつです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"苔好きなのは知ってるけど\n芝生はすき？♡\n▶︎芝生もいいよなー\nふさふさしてるもんなー\nかわいいよなー\n...緑はいいなー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}